      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ac4fd763f8d523278a414f7|full_name}: Sadly you can't do the override swap due to when the avatar is packaged it packages the animations connected to the override. So unless they created a new VRC_Descriptor that lets you load multiple so it pulls them all. This wouldn't be possible.",
