  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently I'm sitting at 200+ avatars. Even more if I include Commissions I end up deleting due to how hard it is to get to my avatars. I'm hoping for the ability to turn off the public avatar tab so we could get a 3rd maybe 4th row on the avatar screen. I have an avatar world so I can't exactly remove avatars and this would help me and others with 100+ avatars greatly.",
